
#import "../../../_lib/kodama.typ": *

#show: kodama

#metadata((
  title: "de Rham",
))

#subtree(
  taxon: "theorem"
)[
  The cotangent complex:
  $
    LL_(cal(O)_(CC_p) slash ZZ_p) & = cal(O)_(CC_p)(1)[1] \
    LL_(W(cal(O)_(CC_p)^flat) slash ZZ_p) & = 0
  $
]

We compute the cotangent complex $LL_(ZZ_(p)[mu_(p^(-infinity))] slash ZZ_p)$, we have:
$
  LL_(ZZ_(p)[mu_(p^(-n))] slash ZZ_p) & = (ZZ_(p)[mu_p^(-n)] d mu_(p^(-n))) / (p^(n - 1/(p-1))) \
  LL_(ZZ_(p)[mu_(p^(-infinity))] slash ZZ_p) & = union.big_(n > 0)  (ZZ_(p)[mu_p^(-infinity)] d mu_(p^(-n))) / (p^(n - 1/(p-1))) 
$
But $LL_(hat(ZZ_(p)[mu_(p^(-n))]) slash ZZ_(p)[mu_(p^(-n))])$ is complete chaos.

